Audio filter registry and sample-format negotiation (src/audio)

src/audio/ holds one descriptor module per audio filter. The per-filter code was
moved, not rewritten, from src/index.ts; its provenance is recorded in NOTICE.

src/audio/chain.ts adapts the audio sample-format negotiation of FFmpeg
libavfilter/avfiltergraph.c and libavfilter/formats.c for bounded linear chains:
format-list merging along links (query_formats, merge_formats_internal),
converter insertion when lists share no format, get_fmt_score and
find_best_sample_fmt_of_2 (pick_format with a reference link),
swap_sample_fmts_on_filter, and the native sample-format enum order that
ff_all_formats and ff_planar_sample_fmts produce. The native lists declared for
volume and adelay follow libavfilter/af_volume.c and libavfilter/af_adelay.c.

